- 1-week 90% CI: ±1.645 × 2.2% × √5 ≈ ±8.1%
- 1-month 90% CI: ±1.645 × 2.2% × √21 ≈ ±16.6%

Point estimates use a slight upward drift assumption (~10% annualized):
- 1-day drift: +0.04%
